From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:00:54 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 406/443] [ae-patch] Pin the iOS audio session to
 play-and-record in Voice mode

After the first cloud reply plays on the audio element, iOS keeps the page's audio session on playback and WebKit speech recognition never switches it back, so every later mic start hears nothing. On WebKit with navigator.audioSession, Voice mode now sets the type to play-and-record when it starts, sets it again before each mic start and after each reply ends, and restores the earlier type when it ends. The mic start log line now shows the type. The Voice panel no longer repeats the heard text under the ring, because the composer draft already shows it.
